.TH MIOS.TOML 5 "" "MiOS 0.3.0" "MiOS Configuration"
.SH NAME
mios.toml \- the MiOS single source of truth
.SH DESCRIPTION
Every MiOS surface is projected from this file: units, ports, themes,
container definitions, verbs and the installers. Editing a
projection by hand is undone by the next build; edit the table
here instead.
.SH SECTIONS
.TP
.B [testing]
table with 1 key(s)
.TP
.B [variants]
table with 2 key(s)
.TP
.B [verbs]
table with 1 key(s)
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/share/mios/mios.toml
The vendor copy that ships in the image.
.TP
.I /etc/mios/mios.toml
Host overrides, layered over the vendor copy.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR mios (1),
.BR mios (7)
